# Report Sync

When `Book1.md` changes, regenerate `report.md` from the current contents of `Book1.md` before finishing the task.

- Recompute the per-chapter word counts from the latest `Book1.md`.
- Preserve the existing report format unless the user asks for a different one.
- If `Book1.md` is updated in any way, treat `report.md` as required follow-up work.
